riginal filing was compliant."},"strongest_uncertainty":"Treating the date-only clause as the resubmission boundary is less closely aligned with the explicit operational launch time. The text does not expressly require resubmission of blackout submissions.","supporting_evidence":[{"quote":"With effect from 2 February 2026, STREAMS 2 will become the only channel for filing STRs2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811"},{"quote":"for any STRs requiring urgent submission during the blackout period of STREAMS","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"},{"quote":"licensed firms are required to re-submit the STRs via STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"}]}],"dimensions":{"definitions":{"reading":"STREAMS 2 is the replacement reporting platform. XML submission, upload of a completed prescribed PDF form and completion of the STREAMS 2 web form are distinct permitted methods. Hongkong Post e-Cert is identified as an electronic certificate.","source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u1.383","da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u6.1149","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"uncertainty":"The XML schema, prescribed PDF and technical meaning of satisfying the e-Cert requirement are not supplied."},"dependencies":{"reading":"Classification criteria, technical submission materials and promised resubmission guidance are not available in the packet. Footnote markers and the split webinar link are retained as cross-reference evidence.","source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u8.1235","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439","da12aecad4e68.u23.2943","da12aecad4e68.u25.3157","da12aecad4e68.u26.3250","da12aecad4e68.u27.3328","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334","da12aecad4e68.u29.3563","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"uncertainty":"The four missing dependency identifiers have no supplied content or mapping to particular referenced materials. Their contents cannot be inferred."},"exceptions":{"reading":"Urgent STRs during the blackout receive a specific direct-contact route. Footnote 3 attaches to the XML and PDF items carrying its marker; the web-form item has no such marker. Resubmission is a separate obligation and does not expressly authorize an alternative filing channel.","source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u6.1149","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"uncertainty":"Direct contact is not expressly equated with completed STR submission. The attachment of the resubmission obligation to filings during the final morning of the blackout depends on the meaning of implementation."},"modality":{"reading":"The channel and submission-method provisions use required language. XML schema conformity and liaison to arrange a technical test are also required. Account registration and observance of transitional arrangements use should. Urgent blackout contact uses please contact. Platform replacement, migration and access are operational statements rather than equivalent duties imposed on firms.","source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u8.1235","da12aecad4e68.u10.1614","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"uncertainty":"The packet does not establish the legal consequences of the different formulations. This proposal preserves their wording without declaring their legal enforceability."},"scope":{"reading":"The selected duty applies to licensed corporations, SFC-licensed virtual asset service providers and associated entities, collectively defined as licensed firms. The selected control is limited to their post-launch STR filings.","source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0","da12aecad4e68.u3.811"],"uncertainty":"The packet names these actor classes but does not supply the criteria for membership, including the meaning of associated entities."},"time":{"reading":"The general channel rule names 2026-02-02. The operational launch and resumption of acceptance occur at 9:00am that day. The blackout begins at 12:00am on 2026-01-28 and ends when acceptance res