 2529 4013;","treatment":"Specific urgent blackout contact route, retained separately.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"},{"quote":"All STRs previously submitted through STREAMS will be migrated to STREAMS 2.","treatment":"Launch time, old-platform discontinuation, migration and access statements; migration does not state that firms must resubmit old STREAMS records.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"},{"quote":"are required to follow the XML schema provided separately by the JFIU","treatment":"Schema dependency and mandatory XML preparation; liaison to arrange testing remains separate from per-filing assessment.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"},{"quote":"Should you have any queries regarding the contents of this circular","treatment":"Inquiry contact information; no additional selected-control requirement.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u15.2675"},{"quote":"Intermediaries Division","treatment":"Issuing-division attribution.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u16.2852"},{"quote":"Securities and Futures Commission","treatment":"Issuer attribution; no invented authority beyond the retained source.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u18.2879"},{"quote":"End","treatment":"Document boundary marker.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u19.2914"},{"quote":"SFO/IS/002/2026","treatment":"Document identifier, not an additional substantive rule.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u20.2919"},{"quote":"held on 17 and 18 November 2025.","treatment":"Footnote 1 historical webinar context and reference to presentation material.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u23.2943"},{"quote":"(https://www.sfc.hk/-/media/EN/files/IS/AML/SFC-AMLCFT-Webinar-202511_JFIU_ENG.pdf?rev=","treatment":"First contiguous fragment of the referenced presentation URL; linked content is not supplied.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u25.3157"},{"quote":"f206230e309e4f5ba196bca77dfe46b9&hash=408F99B6D8750D895676F20D9A09A302).","treatment":"Continuation of the presentation URL, not a separate requirement.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u26.3250"},{"quote":"2","treatment":"Footnote marker linking the channel provision to the following resubmission text.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u27.3328"},{"quote":"The JFIU will provide guidance to facilitate the re-submission.","treatment":"Separate mandatory resubmission provision and unavailable promised guidance.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"quote":"3","treatment":"Footnote marker corresponding to XML and PDF submission items.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u29.3563"},{"quote":"Hongkong Post e-Cert (electronic certificate) is required for this submission.","treatment":"Certificate requirement attached to the marked submission methods; technical satisfaction remains unresolved.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"}]},"method":"Parse each actor, trigger, duty, permission, prohibition and exception; then check cross-references and effective dates.","move":null,"parent":null,"protocol":"legalmath.search.v1","repair_instruction":"Fix the contract/source-reference error using exact supplied units. Preserve source uncertainty and valid substantive alternatives; never fabricate citations.","repair_of_request_hash":"610189ba0a4a53850fdecf92576c1c2e2f09f22ab4b2d10b74332ba5600f16fb","role":"normative","source_packet":{"authority":"RETAINED_SOURCE","dependencies":[{"dependency_id":"missing.39ffa0d54487ee68b17a36b8","source_hash":null},{"dependency_id":"missing.da4d23ff33f664a99e4bf8cc","source_hash":null},{"dependency_id":"missing.f5f807738efdd34996b25ddc","source_hash":null},{"dependency_id":"missing.1557ee52aade13863ae98bda","source_hash":null}],"family_ids":["scope","definitions","exceptions","modality","time","dependencies"],"selected_slice":"For classified licensed firms filing STRs after the STREAMS 2 launch: required reporting channel, permitted submission formats and footnote 3 e-Cert requirement. Retain blackout urgent-contact exception and separate resubmission obligation; do not silently generalize the channel rule into the blackout.","source_key":"assurance.1d77e5e08a758b5fe0a406b9","units":[{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u0.0","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"The Securities and Futures Commission (SFC) issues this circular to inform licensed corporations, SFC-licensed virtual asset service providers and associated entities (collectively referred to as “licensed firms”) about the logistical arrangements for transitioning to the Joint Financial Intelligence Unit’s (JFIU) new suspicious transaction reporting platform by 2 February 2026.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u0.0"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u1.383","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"The JFIU has developed the new platform, the Suspicious Transaction Report and Management System 2 (STREAMS 2)1, which will replace the current STREAMS platform. By enhancing system automation and analytical capabilities, the new platform increases the efficiency and effectiveness of the JFIU’s analysis and dissemination of financial intelligence gathered from suspicious transaction reports (STRs) received.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u1.383"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u2.795","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"STR submission","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u2.795"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"With effect from 2 February 2026, STREAMS 2 will become the only channel for filing STRs2. Licensed firms are required to submit STRs to the JFIU via STREAMS 2 by one of the following means:","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"(a)  submission of an STR in an Extensible Markup Language (XML) format3;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"(b)  uploading a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format3; or","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"(c)  completing the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u7.1203","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"STREAMS 2 account registration","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u7.1203"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u8.1235","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"Licensed firms should register STREAMS 2 user accounts to facilitate the prompt submission of STRs. For new user registration, please download the STREAMS 2 User Registration Form available on the JFIU website (https://www.jfiu.gov.hk/info/doc/STREAMS_2_Reg_form.docx), and submit the completed form to the JFIU via email (jfiu@police.gov.hk).","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u8.1235"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u9.1580","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"System transitional arrangements","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u9.1580"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u10.1614","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"Licensed firms should observe the JFIU’s transitional arrangements as set out below:","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u10.1614"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"(a)  the JFIU will cease accepting STR submissions via STREAMS at 12:00am on 28 January 2026, and will resume accepting STR submissions at 9:00am on 2 February 2026 via STREAMS 2 (hereafter referred to as the “blackout period of STREAMS”);","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"(b)  for any STRs requiring urgent submission during the blackout period of STREAMS, please contact the JFIU directly by email (jfiu@police.gov.hk), phone at 2866 3366 or fax at 2529 4013;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"(c)  upon the launch of STREAMS 2 at 9:00am on 2 February 2026, the operation of STREAMS will be discontinued. All STRs previously submitted through STREAMS will be migrated to STREAMS 2. Licensed firms will be able to access these records and, where applicable, view the consent status, via STREAMS 2; and","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u14.2439","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"(d)  licensed firms that intend to submit STRs via the XML format are required to follow the XML schema provided separately by the JFIU and liaise with it as soon as possible to arrange a technical test to ensure a smooth transition.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u15.2675","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"Should you have any queries regarding the contents of this circular, please contact the JFIU’s Senior Inspector Mr Owen Tse at 3660 0533 or by email (owencytse@police.gov.hk).","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u15.2675"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u16.2852","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"Intermediaries Division","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u16.2852"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u18.2879","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"Securities and Futures Commission","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u18.2879"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u19.2914","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"End","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u19.2914"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u20.2919","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"SFO/IS/002/2026","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u20.2919"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u23.2943","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"1 STREAMS 2 was introduced by the JFIU during the Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Financing of Terrorism Webinar held on 17 and 18 November 2025. The presentation material is accessible on the SFC website","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u23.2943"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u25.3157","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"(https://www.sfc.hk/-/media/EN/files/IS/AML/SFC-AMLCFT-Webinar-202511_JFIU_ENG.pdf?rev=","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u25.3157"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u26.3250","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"f206230e309e4f5ba196bca77dfe46b9&hash=408F99B6D8750D895676F20D9A09A302).","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u26.3250"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u27.3328","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"2","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u27.3328"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"For STRs submitted to the JFIU via channels other than STREAMS 2 following its implementation, licensed firms are required to re-submit the STRs via STREAMS 2. The JFIU will provide guidance to facilitate the re-submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u29.3563","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"3","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u29.3563"},{"locator":"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569","normative":true,"span":null,"text":"Hongkong Post e-Cert (electronic certificate) is required for this submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"}]},"task":"REPAIR_OUTPUT","validation_details":"{'model': 'Generation', 'total_errors': 17, 'validation_errors': [{'type': 'missing', 'loc': ['readings'], 'msg': 'Field required'}, {'type': 'list_type', 'loc': ['dimensions'], 'msg': 'Input should be a valid list'}, {'type': 'missing', 'loc': ['coverage'], 'msg': 'Field required'}, {'type': 'missing', 'loc': ['questions'], 'msg': 'Field required'}, {'type': 'extra_forbidden', 'loc': ['protocol'], 'msg': 'Extra inputs are not permitted'}, {'type': 'extra_forbidden', 'loc': ['task'], 'msg': 'Extra inputs are not permitted'}, {'type': 'extra_forbidden', 'loc': ['source_key'], 'msg': 'Extra inputs are not permitted'}, {'type': 'extra_forbidden', 'loc': ['authority'], 'msg': 'Extra inputs are not permitted'}, {'type': 'extra_forbidden', 'loc': ['proposal_status'], 'msg': 'Extra inputs are not permitted'}, {'type': 'extra_forbidden', 'loc': ['selected_control'], 'msg': 'Extra inputs are not permitted'}, {'type': 'extra_forbidden', 'loc': ['facts'], 'msg': 'Extra inputs are not permitted'},","validation_error":"E_SCHEMA"},"configuration":"ignore-user-config; read-only; tools-disabled; no-resume","events_jsonl":"{\"type\":\"thread.started\",\"thread_id\":\"01a0d8c0-1660-7702-b762-e03936c4822e\"}\n{\"type\":\"turn.started\"}\n{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"coverage\\\":[{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Used as actor-scope definition and transition context.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"INTERPRETED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u0.0\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Used as platform replacement definition and contextual background.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"CONTEXT\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u1.383\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Used as heading for the selected STR-submission control.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"CONTEXT\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u2.795\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Used as mandatory channel rule and effective-date evidence.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"INTERPRETED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u3.811\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Used as XML method with footnote 3 attachment.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"INTERPRETED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Used as prescribed PDF method with footnote 3 attachment.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"INTERPRETED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Used as web-form alternative.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"INTERPRETED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Used as registration heading, outside selected filing control.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"CONTEXT\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u7.1203\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Registration recommendation and email process retained as separate obligation.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"INTERPRETED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u8.1235\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Used as transitional-arrangements heading.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"CONTEXT\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u9.1580\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Used to characterize transitional language as “should”.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"INTERPRETED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u10.1614\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Used for blackout start and 9:00am resumption.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"INTERPRETED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Used for urgent blackout direct-contact arrangement.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"INTERPRETED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Used for launch-time wording, discontinuation and migration.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"INTERPRETED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Used for mandatory XML-schema and technical-test arrangement.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"INTERPRETED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u14.2439\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Used as inquiry contact only.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"CONTEXT\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u15.2675\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Used for issuing-division attribution.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"CONTEXT\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u16.2852\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"No substantive text beyond issuer attribution supplied.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"CONTEXT\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u18.2879\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Document boundary marker.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"CONTEXT\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u19.2914\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Document identifier only.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"CONTEXT\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u20.2919\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Historical webinar context.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"CONTEXT\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u23.2943\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"First fragment of referenced presentation URL; linked content unavailable.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"DEFERRED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u25.3157\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Continuation of referenced presentation URL; linked content unavailable.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"DEFERRED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u26.3250\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Footnote 2 marker linking to resubmission text.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"INTERPRETED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u27.3328\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Separate resubmission obligation and promised guidance.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"INTERPRETED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Footnote 3 marker linking to certificate text.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"INTERPRETED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u29.3563\\\"},{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Hongkong Post e-Cert requirement for marked methods.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"INTERPRETED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569\\\"}],\\\"dimensions\\\":[{\\\"dimension\\\":\\\"scope\\\",\\\"explanation\\\":\\\"The text defines “licensed firms” as “licensed corporations, SFC-licensed virtual asset service providers and associated entities”. The selected control concerns those actors' STR filings. Whether an entity is an associated entity remains a classification question.\\\",\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"da12aecad4e68.u0.0\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u3.811\\\"],\\\"status\\\":\\\"PROPOSED\\\"},{\\\"dimension\\\":\\\"definitions\\\",\\\"explanation\\\":\\\"STREAMS 2 replaces STREAMS. The three listed methods are XML, completed prescribed PDF upload, and the STREAMS 2 web form. “Hongkong Post e-Cert (electronic certificate)” is required for the XML and PDF items marked with footnote 3; the packet does not define the technical act that satisfies it.\\\",\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"da12aecad4e68.u1.383\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u29.3563\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569\\\"],\\\"status\\\":\\\"PROPOSED\\\"},{\\\"dimension\\\":\\\"exceptions\\\",\\\"explanation\\\":\\\"During the blackout, urgent STR matters are directed to contact the JFIU by email, phone or fax. That contact route is separate from the post-launch STREAMS 2 rule. The source separately requires re-submission of STRs made through other channels “following its implementation”; it does not expressly say that every blackout contact is an STR submission or state a resubmission deadline.\\\",\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334\\\"],\\\"status\\\":\\\"AMBIGUOUS\\\"},{\\\"dimension\\\":\\\"modality\\\",\\\"explanation\\\":\\\"“are required to submit” and “are required to follow” express mandatory wording. Registration and transitional arrangements use “should”; urgent contact uses “please contact”. The packet does not establish the legal consequence of each formulation beyond preserving the wording.\\\",\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"da12aecad4e68.u3.811\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u8.1235\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u10.1614\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u14.2439\\\"],\\\"status\\\":\\\"PROPOSED\\\"},{\\\"dimension\\\":\\\"time\\\",\\\"explanation\\\":\\\"One reading treats “following its implementation” as beginning at the 9:00am launch on 2026-02-02. A competing reading treats the general date “With effect from 2 February 2026” as the resubmission boundary, while retaining the blackout until 9:00am. The source does not specify a timezone.\\\",\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"da12aecad4e68.u3.811\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334\\\"],\\\"status\\\":\\\"AMBIGUOUS\\\"},{\\\"dimension\\\":\\\"dependencies\\\",\\\"explanation\\\":\\\"XML conformity depends on a separately provided JFIU schema, and the source promises resubmission guidance. The webinar presentation URL is supplied only in fragments. The contents of these materials are unavailable, so their requirements cannot be inferred.\\\",\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"da12aecad4e68.u14.2439\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u23.2943\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u25.3157\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u26.3250\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334\\\"],\\\"status\\\":\\\"AMBIGUOUS\\\"}],\\\"questions\\\":[\\\"Does “following its implementation” mean the 9:00am launch or the calendar date 2026-02-02?\\\",\\\"When does urgent blackout contact constitute an actual STR submission?\\\",\\\"What technical act satisfies the Hongkong Post e-Cert requirement?\\\",\\\"Which timezone governs the stated times?\\\",\\\"What are the contents of the separately provided XML schema and promised resubmission guidance?\\\"],\\\"readings\\\":[{\\\"assumptions\\\":[\\\"The selected control is evaluated only for a classified licensed firm and an actual STR filing.\\\",\\\"Unknown facts remain unknown rather than being treated as false.\\\",\\\"Footnote 3 attaches to the XML and prescribed-PDF items because those items carry the marker; the web-form item does not carry it.\\\"],\\\"citations\\\":[{\\\"quote\\\":\\\"Licensed firms are required to submit STRs to the JFIU via STREAMS 2 by one of the following means:\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u3.811\\\"},{\\\"quote\\\":\\\"upon the launch of STREAMS 2 at 9:00am on 2 February 2026\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131\\\"},{\\\"quote\\\":\\\"For STRs submitted to the JFIU via channels other than STREAMS 2 following its implementation\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334\\\"}],\\\"distinction\\\":\\\"Operational-launch reading: “following its implementation” begins at the explicit 9:00am STREAMS 2 launch. An off-channel STR filed at or after that time triggers the separate resubmission obligation. The strongest uncertainty is that footnote 2 does not expressly define implementation by reference to the launch time.\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"time\\\",\\\"formalization\\\":{\\\"facts\\\":[{\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The actor belongs to one of the classes collectively called licensed firms.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"is_licensed_firm\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"da12aecad4e68.u0.0\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"Boolean classification\\\"},{\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The event is an actual STR filing to the JFIU.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"is_str_filing\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"da12aecad4e68.u3.811\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941\\\",\\\"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"Boolean event classification\\\"},{\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The filing occurs at or after the 9:00am operational launch on 2026-02-02.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"at_or_after_operational_launch\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"da12aecad4e68.u11.170